WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
And so the Nobel Peace Prize will be announced on Friday.

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.800
You've been nominated by many world leaders.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:07.960
By many, many countries.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:08.540
That's right.

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:11.840
By many countries, as well as the hostage families.

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:13.400
Do you think you will win?

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.160
I have no idea.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.120
I mean, look, I did settle.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:19.360
Marco would tell you we settled seven wars.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:21.600
We're close to settling an eighth.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.879
And I think we'll end up settling the Russia

00:00:23.879 --> 00:00:25.240
situation, which is horrible.

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.959
7,000 people died last week, by the way,

00:00:27.959 --> 00:00:30.719
in Russia, between Russia and Ukraine.

00:00:30.719 --> 00:00:31.840
I think we'll settle that.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:35.439
So I don't think anybody in history has settled that many.

00:00:35.439 --> 00:00:38.240
But perhaps they'll find a reason not to give it to me.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:38.799
You know?

00:00:38.799 --> 00:00:39.639
Perhaps they will.

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:44.680
Mr. President, thank you so much, Mr. President.

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:45.240
Thank you.

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:47.080
Going to the shutdown quickly, what

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.959
is your position on the extension of health care

00:00:49.959 --> 00:00:52.560
subsidies, which is what Democrats are asking for?

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:54.360
All I want to do is very simple.

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:56.480
I want to get the country open.

00:00:56.480 --> 00:00:58.279
And then we're going to discuss that.

00:00:58.279 --> 00:00:59.279
And we'd like to.

00:00:59.279 --> 00:01:01.639
Obamacare is a horrible mess.

00:01:01.639 --> 00:01:03.599
And it has been from the beginning.

00:01:03.599 --> 00:01:05.160
We want to make it better, stronger.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.879
Even if it costs more money, it costs more money.

00:01:07.879 --> 00:01:08.919
We want to make it better.

00:01:08.919 --> 00:01:10.519
The Democrats want to make it worse.

00:01:10.519 --> 00:01:13.680
The Democrats want to approve health care for illegals

00:01:13.680 --> 00:01:15.400
coming into our country, many of them

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:18.540
coming in from prisons, and mental institutions,

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:20.040
and drug dealers.

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:21.680
They want to give them health care.

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:23.120
We don't want that for our people,

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:24.800
because that's going to destroy the health care

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:26.000
that we already have.

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:29.120
We'd like to make Obamacare better, better for people,

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:31.239
less expensive, and better health care.

00:01:31.239 --> 00:01:32.239
Yes, ma'am.

00:01:32.239 --> 00:01:34.480
Mr. President, I'm wondering if you've

00:01:34.480 --> 00:01:38.680
been briefed on the organization and funding of Antifa.

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:40.239
And if so, what have you learned?

00:01:40.239 --> 00:01:40.839
I have been.

00:01:40.839 --> 00:01:42.739
And they have pretty good knowledge.

00:01:42.739 --> 00:01:44.199
But they're going to have a very good knowledge.

00:01:44.199 --> 00:01:46.879
And I really ask these very brave patriots

00:01:46.879 --> 00:01:49.400
that we're surrounded with today to let us know,

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.720
because I think you probably have some pretty good ideas.

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:53.680
And even if you're not sure, let us know,

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.000
and we'll figure it out, OK?

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.580
If you could do that.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:57.559
I don't know.

00:01:57.559 --> 00:01:58.559
I don't know.

00:01:58.559 --> 00:01:59.540
I don't know.

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:00.040
I don't know.

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:02.580
I'm not from the Middle East.

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:03.419
Can you specify?

00:02:03.419 --> 00:02:04.559
You're from Italy?

00:02:04.559 --> 00:02:05.040
No.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.400
I'm from France.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.479
Can you specify how close we are to the deal?

00:02:08.479 --> 00:02:10.279
Would that be announced today or tomorrow?

00:02:10.279 --> 00:02:12.880
And do you want to see the hostages released before you

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:14.479
travel to the region?

00:02:14.479 --> 00:02:14.979
No.

00:02:14.979 --> 00:02:18.039
I think I'll probably go maybe before the hostages are

00:02:18.039 --> 00:02:21.100
released, or shortly thereafter, pretty much shortly thereafter.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:21.820
Yeah, please.

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:23.779
I'm not participating in any of the negotiations.

00:02:23.779 --> 00:02:24.279
Mr. President.

00:02:24.279 --> 00:02:24.839
Go ahead.

00:02:24.839 --> 00:02:25.479
Who are you with?

00:02:25.479 --> 00:02:26.679
Who are you with?

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:27.639
The center square.

00:02:27.639 --> 00:02:30.320
I had the honor of asking you originally

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:33.600
if you would designate Antifa a terror organization.

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:35.399
And I stand here before you today,

00:02:35.399 --> 00:02:37.880
and I'm echoing what Andy said over here.

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:39.839
Are you going to work with your administration

00:02:39.839 --> 00:02:41.440
as the Secretary of State's here?

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:43.279
Are you going to work with your administration

00:02:43.279 --> 00:02:45.880
to designate it a foreign terror organization?

00:02:45.880 --> 00:02:47.880
You mean it a terror?

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:48.679
Antifa.

00:02:48.679 --> 00:02:49.320
Antifa.

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:50.720
A foreign terror organization.

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:52.279
Well, has that been done?

00:02:52.279 --> 00:02:53.360
Pretty close, right?

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:54.600
Would you like to see it done?

00:02:54.600 --> 00:02:55.279
Yes, Mr. President.

00:02:55.279 --> 00:02:56.000
Do you think it would help?

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.160
They have foreign links all across Western Europe.

00:02:58.160 --> 00:02:58.360
I'd be glad to do it.

00:02:58.360 --> 00:02:59.720
I think it's the kind of thing I'd like to do.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:00.360
If you'd like to.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:01.880
Does everybody agree?

00:03:01.880 --> 00:03:02.919
If you agree, I agree.

00:03:02.919 --> 00:03:04.199
Let's get it done, OK?

00:03:04.199 --> 00:03:05.080
Let's get it done.

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:06.600
Marco, we'll take care of it.

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:07.440
Mr. President.

00:03:07.440 --> 00:03:08.880
That's international, you mean.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:10.080
International.

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:12.160
Sounds good to me.

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:14.720
Steve, are you OK with it?

